# The static-port placement model's input (--port-plan-out, foldsim-fold-static
# port-plan-out; report only): every page engine member's read and write
# positions as placed, each class virtual memory's instances' state passes,
# widths and kinds. Driver/Inputs/vmem_multi, two copies, on page engines
# (vmem-on-engines): 16 memories, 8 engines; each member's positions are its
# copy's state passes (instance i at slot[kState][i]), no two members of an
# engine share a position, and the netlist is the same with and without it.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmem_multi
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/a --static --virtual-memories 'Leaf:.*' --copies Leaf:2 --page-engines 16 --vmem-on-engines Leaf --port-plan-out %t/plan.json > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/b --static --virtual-memories 'Leaf:.*' --copies Leaf:2 --page-engines 16 --vmem-on-engines Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: sed -e 's#//.*##' %t/a/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/a.sv
# RUN: sed -e 's#//.*##' %t/b/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/b.sv
# RUN: diff %t/a.sv %t/b.sv
# RUN: python3 %S/Inputs/port_plan_check.py %t/plan.json | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: engines 8 members 16
# CHECK: classes 2 memories 16 on engines 16
# CHECK: members at their state passes: 16
# CHECK: shared positions: 0
